/*! \page sdk_quickstart OCUDU dApp SDK Quickstart

This page summarizes the SDK walkthrough in OCUDU Doxygen style. The full
command-level guide is the Git Markdown companion
\c docs/ocudu_dapp_quickstart.md.

\section sdk_qs_flow End-to-end flow

\code{.text}
scaffold / copy reference  ->  build package (so|exe + manifest + SPDX)
        -> offline certify (Class A CUDA)
        -> stage catalog on DU host
        -> (production) ocudu-dapp-package sign / trust
        -> DU YAML package_manifests [+ initial_instances]
        -> E3 load -> prepare -> arm -> shadow -> activate
        -> metrics / incidents / health
\endcode

\section sdk_qs_vendor Multi-vendor template

Copy \c examples/vendor_min for install-only commercial Class-A packages
(\c find_package(OCUDUDapp), shared \c package_config). See Markdown guides
\c docs/vendor_toolkit.md and \c docs/package_config.md.

\section sdk_qs_scaffold Class-A CUDA scaffold

\code{.sh}
python3 tools/scaffold_class_a_cuda.py \
  --kind receiver \
  --target my_neural_rx_cuda \
  --global-name com.example.ran.neural-rx.cuda \
  --package-id $(uuidgen) \
  --output ../my-neural-rx-dapp
\endcode

Kinds: \c ce (\c 0x00010003), \c equalizer (\c 0x00010004),
\c receiver (\c 0x00010005). Replace only \c algorithm.cu; keep pure query and
lifecycle shells.

\section sdk_qs_build Build and certify

\code{.sh}
cmake -S . -B build -DCMAKE_PREFIX_PATH=$OCUDU_PREFIX -DCMAKE_CUDA_ARCHITECTURES=121
cmake --build build -j
certify_class_a_cuda build/my_neural_rx_cuda.so 0x00010005
\endcode

\section sdk_qs_classes Classes B and C

- Class B: copy \c reference/scheduler; see \ref sdk_class_b.
- Class C: copy native or process references; see \ref sdk_class_c_cuda and
  \ref sdk_observer_authority.

\section sdk_qs_du Host enablement

Install OCUDU with \c ENABLE_DAPP=ON and \c ENABLE_E3=ON. Configure catalog
root, package manifests, optional signatures, and \c local_e3. Manage instances
with \c ocudu-dappctl or the Python client. Full YAML and lifecycle tables:
Markdown quickstart and OCUDU \c dapp_quickstart / \c e3_management pages.

\section sdk_qs_related Related pages

\ref sdk_reference_packages · \ref sdk_tools · \ref sdk_class_a_cuda ·
OCUDU E3 management, wire, and system design guides.

*/
